  <div id="keys" hidden role="dialog" aria-label="Keyboard shortcuts"><div class="box">
    <h3>Keyboard shortcuts</h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td><kbd>N</kbd></td><td>Next item</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>P</kbd></td><td>Previous item</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>F</kbd></td><td>Full screen on / off</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>M</kbd></td><td>Show / hide the contents</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>A</kbd></td><td>Annotate on / off</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>1</kbd>–<kbd>4</kbd></td><td>Pen · highlighter · eraser · text note</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>C</kbd> <kbd>S</kbd></td><td>Change color · change size</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>Z</kbd></td><td>Undo (<kbd>Shift</kbd>+<kbd>Z</kbd> redo)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>K</kbd></td><td>Play / pause the music or video</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>J</kbd> <kbd>L</kbd></td><td>Back · forward 10 seconds</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>U</kbd></td><td>Mute / unmute</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>H</kbd></td><td>Hide / show the mini-player (uploaded audio and video keep playing)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>V</kbd></td><td>Mini-player: full player (with video) / slim bar</td></tr>
      <tr><td>⏯ ⏭ ⏮</td><td>Media keys and headphone buttons: play / pause, next, previous (also the lock screen on phones)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>?</kbd></td><td>Show this list</td></tr>
      <tr><td><kbd>Esc</kbd></td><td>Close / exit full screen</td></tr>
    </table>
    <p>Notes are saved on this device only. Shortcuts work whenever you're not typing in a box. Inside a video player from YouTube or Spotify, click outside the player first.</p>
  </div></div>
</section>
